==English==

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|pl=cerebellums|pl2=cerebella}}

# {{neuroanatomy}} Part of the [[hindbrain]] in [[vertebrate]]s. In [[human]]s it lies between the [[brainstem]] and the [[cerebrum]]. It plays an important role in sensory perception, motor output, balance and posture.

====Holonyms====
* [[hindbrain]]

